libxml2 and libxslt
-------------------

Parts of libxmq are ported from libxml2 and libxslt, directly or through the
java port in src/main/java/org/libxmq/imp/xml. Those files
carry the upstream copyright notices. This section credits the people behind
that code.

Note: the libxslt license says that the names of its authors shall not be
used in advertising or otherwise to promote the sale, use or other dealings
in the software without prior written authorization. This list is a credit,
not an endorsement by any of them.

